From 83e515ba500019350c46b592252b23dfbd3bd5ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SP11 audio reconstruction <sp11-audio@localhost>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 13:03:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qcom: add SP11 protected integrated graph

Add exact extended AudioReach container properties, validated ordered calibration stages, retained out-of-band SET_CFG transport, integrated frontend/backend graph handling, strict media and calibration error propagation, and the WSA884x protection-port playback-stream clash guard required by the recovered Surface Pro 11 Windows DEFAULT speaker graph.

Signed-off-by: SP11 audio reconstruction <sp11-audio@localhost>
